{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Danmo Three Kingdoms: Battle of Wits</i> is a strategy game set in the turbulent era of the Three Kingdoms, blending traditional board game thinking with sandbox-style wargame gameplay. With straightforward rules and clear strategic depth, it offers an immersive experience of &quot;commanding the world as on a chessboard.&quot; Here are the key features of the gameplay:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/76784c1c1053aa86d795ae7ea6939db1.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Skip the early grind and dive straight into tactical maneuvering from the moment you enter the battlefield.</u></strong> Leverage troop type counters, commander synergies, and terrain advantages to capture key cities within a limited number of turns\u2014whether through a direct stronghold assault or by cutting enemy supply lines. Every deployment of your forces is a test of your wisdom and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8e64baee3d345f114ae8c09fea9eb008.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8e64baee3d345f114ae8c09fea9eb008.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8e64baee3d345f114ae8c09fea9eb008.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8016ebba289ecb99502bade04084eb72.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Transcend the boundaries of nations and factions to assemble your ultimate team freely.</u></strong> Witness L\u00fc Bu and Guan Yu fighting side by side, or have Diaochan and the Qiao sisters unleash their charm together on the same stage. Here, you can recruit the greatest, whether for their strength or their beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/6b052b3ed086e3bffbd6edf218e03361.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/6b052b3ed086e3bffbd6edf218e03361.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/6b052b3ed086e3bffbd6edf218e03361.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/0d0494bd2eb01496a3819138bf73663e.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Danmo Three Kingdoms: Battle of Wits</i>, we aim not only to recreate the turbulent upheavals of the Three Kingdoms era but also to grant you the power to rewrite history. From grand alliances to lone-wolf campaigns, every conflict is born from the crucial decisions shared by the Lord and the Strategist. Whether you choose to aid a destined ruler or carve your own unique path through the chaos, we hope this work presents you with a tapestry of strategy\u2014one to reflect upon, replay, and rethink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/27b83e833a5b1d61ee3fa8c3bf4c4722.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/27b83e833a5b1d61ee3fa8c3bf4c4722.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/27b83e833a5b1d61ee3fa8c3bf4c4722.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/859283afe98ff8d4dcf72642b3b0253b.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The game supports online matches for up to eight players,</u></strong> allowing you to compete against strategists from around the world.Win battles and campaigns to unlock more Three Kingdoms heroes. Commander combinations, tactical adaptations, and timely stratagems\u2014every move is a test of strategic wits, and every match holds the potential to reshape the outcome of the era.Win battles and campaigns to unlock more Three Kingdoms heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/ff2f72af12318b5e23eea4709437bbdf.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/ff2f72af12318b5e23eea4709437bbdf.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/ff2f72af12318b5e23eea4709437bbdf.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Within the confines of the board, you script centuries of turmoil; with a single piece placed, destinies rise and fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master Strategist, the war drums echo\u2014step into the fray and claim the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/b03a90ef259b16a834aa2ce7de5a7d2e.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an independent Chinese development team passionate about history and strategy games. During development, just finalizing the art style alone went through more than five iterations. For us, this process was both a series of sprints and a long-distance journey. We ran back and forth between realism and artistic expression multiple times before finally finding the path we're on now\u2014a style that won't overwhelm you with heavy colors nor leave you unimpressed with faint lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s like a brilliant strategist in the midst of battle\u2014not stealing the general\u2019s spotlight, but stepping in at the key moment to bring the entire campaign to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/4f6b5c105566be49c00736baa16adb16.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/4f6b5c105566be49c00736baa16adb16.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/4f6b5c105566be49c00736baa16adb16.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development, and we sincerely welcome your active feedback to help us keep improving. We plan to add more Three Kingdoms commanders in future updates, along with continuously developing new storylines for everyone to experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3905040?t=1765191089","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/6462ab491ac0054d737c3218d49804fcd4e1da80/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765191089","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/301954065ccd535bc95ae479ac1b1acfb9384cd7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765191089","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/301954065ccd535bc95ae479ac1b1acfb9384cd7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765191089","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4041860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>All fellow &quot;Mo You&quot; gather here!\ud83d\udc47</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/849fec2d31185a410bc51159c1fd9890.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1280 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings, fellow &quot;Mo You&quot;! Follow or join our official communities and info accounts to get the latest game updates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official QQ Group: 621952633</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xiaohongshu/Bilibili: Danmo Three Kingdoms (\u4e39\u58a8\u4e09\u56fd)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Baidu Tieba: Danmo Three Kingdoms Bar (\u4e39\u58a8\u4e09\u56fd\u5427)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay in the loop for all the newest news!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Danmo Three Kingdoms: Battle of Wits</i> is a strategy game set in the turbulent era of the Three Kingdoms, blending traditional board game thinking with sandbox-style wargame gameplay. With straightforward rules and clear strategic depth, it offers an immersive experience of &quot;commanding the world as on a chessboard.&quot; Here are the key features of the gameplay:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/76784c1c1053aa86d795ae7ea6939db1.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Skip the early grind and dive straight into tactical maneuvering from the moment you enter the battlefield.</u></strong> Leverage troop type counters, commander synergies, and terrain advantages to capture key cities within a limited number of turns\u2014whether through a direct stronghold assault or by cutting enemy supply lines. Every deployment of your forces is a test of your wisdom and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8e64baee3d345f114ae8c09fea9eb008.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8e64baee3d345f114ae8c09fea9eb008.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8e64baee3d345f114ae8c09fea9eb008.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/8016ebba289ecb99502bade04084eb72.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Transcend the boundaries of nations and factions to assemble your ultimate team freely.</u></strong> Witness L\u00fc Bu and Guan Yu fighting side by side, or have Diaochan and the Qiao sisters unleash their charm together on the same stage. Here, you can recruit the greatest, whether for their strength or their beauty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/6b052b3ed086e3bffbd6edf218e03361.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/6b052b3ed086e3bffbd6edf218e03361.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/6b052b3ed086e3bffbd6edf218e03361.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/0d0494bd2eb01496a3819138bf73663e.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Danmo Three Kingdoms: Battle of Wits</i>, we aim not only to recreate the turbulent upheavals of the Three Kingdoms era but also to grant you the power to rewrite history. From grand alliances to lone-wolf campaigns, every conflict is born from the crucial decisions shared by the Lord and the Strategist. Whether you choose to aid a destined ruler or carve your own unique path through the chaos, we hope this work presents you with a tapestry of strategy\u2014one to reflect upon, replay, and rethink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/27b83e833a5b1d61ee3fa8c3bf4c4722.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/27b83e833a5b1d61ee3fa8c3bf4c4722.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/27b83e833a5b1d61ee3fa8c3bf4c4722.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/859283afe98ff8d4dcf72642b3b0253b.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The game supports online matches for up to eight players,</u></strong> allowing you to compete against strategists from around the world.Win battles and campaigns to unlock more Three Kingdoms heroes. Commander combinations, tactical adaptations, and timely stratagems\u2014every move is a test of strategic wits, and every match holds the potential to reshape the outcome of the era.Win battles and campaigns to unlock more Three Kingdoms heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/ff2f72af12318b5e23eea4709437bbdf.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/ff2f72af12318b5e23eea4709437bbdf.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/ff2f72af12318b5e23eea4709437bbdf.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> Within the confines of the board, you script centuries of turmoil; with a single piece placed, destinies rise and fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master Strategist, the war drums echo\u2014step into the fray and claim the realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/b03a90ef259b16a834aa2ce7de5a7d2e.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1560 height=413 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an independent Chinese development team passionate about history and strategy games. During development, just finalizing the art style alone went through more than five iterations. For us, this process was both a series of sprints and a long-distance journey. We ran back and forth between realism and artistic expression multiple times before finally finding the path we're on now\u2014a style that won't overwhelm you with heavy colors nor leave you unimpressed with faint lines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s like a brilliant strategist in the midst of battle\u2014not stealing the general\u2019s spotlight, but stepping in at the key moment to bring the entire campaign to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/4f6b5c105566be49c00736baa16adb16.poster.avif?t=1765191089\" width=1170 height=656 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/4f6b5c105566be49c00736baa16adb16.webm?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905040/extras/4f6b5c105566be49c00736baa16adb16.mp4?t=1765191089\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is still in development, and we sincerely welcome your a